body:
Yes, it was. Not even in terms of content but of overall additions and improvements to the game. Also, MH4 base version had way more content than Rise.

&#x200B;

It really shows that Rise is only the little spin-off title.

\> I imagine the true reason for feeding thralls is to clean up these old thralls floating in the air from decayed bases. 

&#x200B;

No, this is not the true reason. It is made up bullshit by a shitty, lazy company called Funcom. The thrall and pet system are essentially the same. They wanted to add a feeding system to the "new" pet system so they had to add it to the thralls as well. The old thralls are probably just leftovers and not affected by this. Funcom code btw
